    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d516">

                <pb facs="0620" n="538" sameAs="frus:frus1865p3/pg538"/>

                <head>Mr. Seward to Mr.
                        Romero</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State,
                            Washington,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1861-05-07"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >May</hi> 7, 1861.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: The government of the United States
                    contemplates the concentration of a body of troops from its Pacific possessions
                    in the Territory of Arizona. This purpose can be most expeditiously accomplished
                    if the government of Mexico will consent to their being landed at Guaymas, and
                    marched by the most direct route to their destination. In this exigency I have
                    the honor to request you to<pb facs="0621" n="539" xml:id="pg539"/>submit to the
                    friendly consideration of the Mexican government the desire I have expressed,
                    with a view to obtain the necessary permission; and I presume that in submitting
                    the proposition there is scarcely any need that it should be accompanied with
                    the assurance that in making the transit over Mexican territory the strictest
                    regard shall be paid to the rights and authority of the government, and the
                    persons, property, and interests of the citizens of the republic.</p>
                <p>I avail myself of this opportunity to renew to you, sir, the assurance of my high
                    consideration.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM H. SEWARD.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Señor <hi rendition="#small-caps">Matias Romero, &amp;c., &amp;c.,
                            &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
